    "created_at": "2020-01-07T17:17:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-01-07T17:17:42Z",
    "body": "I think the problem here is that the tests for the AWS module will parse the region out of the `~/.aws/config` file. I think the fix should be to add `#[ignore]` (similar to the tests that depend on a particular version of something to be installed) to the [`no_region_set`](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/tests/testsuite/aws.rs#L9-L18) and [`region_not_set_with_display_region`](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/tests/testsuite/aws.rs#L237-L249).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
